{"id":"81463b3b86358590","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/069_模型消去_Model_Elimination.md","title":"069 模型消去 Model Elimination","display":"069_模型消去_Model_Elimination","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-子句签名\">1. 子句签名</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\">\\(Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var,fun,rel,pos,neg\">\\(var,fun,rel,pos,neg\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、原子、文字与子句\">2. 项、原子、文字与子句</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F(f)=n\">\\(ar_F(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"At_\\Sigma\">\\(At_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in Rel\">\\(R\\in Rel\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R(R)=n\">\\(ar_R(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(rel(R,\\tau)\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>文字集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pos(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(pos(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(neg(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>子句集合严格定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义多重集成员、空子句、单文字、加法、截断删除与长度：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;K=L,\\\\0,&amp;K\\ne L,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;K=L,\\\\0,&amp;K\\ne L,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n(C\\ominus[L])(K)=\n\\begin{cases}C(L)-1,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)&gt;0,\\\\C(K),&amp;K\\ne L,\\\\0,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)=0,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n(C\\ominus[L])(K)=\n\\begin{cases}C(L)-1,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)&gt;0,\\\\C(K),&amp;K\\ne L,\\\\0,&amp;K=L\\land C(L)=0,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:n\\to Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(e:n\\to Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>，其多重集像定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mset}(e)(L)=|\\{i&lt;n:e(i)=L\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mset}(e)(L)=|\\{i&lt;n:e(i)=L\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C+D\">\\(C+D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C-\\{L\\}\">\\(C-\\{L\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{L\\}\">\\(\\{L\\}\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\oplus D\">\\(C\\oplus D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\ominus[L]\">\\(C\\ominus[L]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[L]\">\\([L]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>补文字函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline{pos(P)}=neg(P),\\qquad \\overline{neg(P)}=pos(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline{pos(P)}=neg(P),\\qquad \\overline{neg(P)}=pos(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换、合一\">3. 自由变量、替换、合一</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数由下列方程给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\qquad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 逐项作用：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\n\\quad\nfun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\n\\quad\nfun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\theta=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\n\\quad\npos(P)\\theta=pos(P\\theta),\n\\quad\nneg(P)\\theta=neg(P\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rel(R,\\tau)\\theta=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\n\\quad\npos(P)\\theta=pos(P\\theta),\n\\quad\nneg(P)\\theta=neg(P\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子句上的替换是保持重数的多重集像：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\theta)(K)\n=\n\\sum_{\\substack{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)\\\\L\\theta=K}}C(L)\n\\qquad(K\\in Lit_\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\theta)(K)\n=\n\\sum_{\\substack{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)\\\\L\\theta=K}}C(L)\n\\qquad(K\\in Lit_\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MGU(P,Q,\\theta)\">\\(MGU(P,Q,\\theta)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\theta=Q\\theta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\theta=Q\\theta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\eta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\eta=Q\\eta\">\\(P\\eta=Q\\eta\\)</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in Var\\ \\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in Var\\ \\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-链文字与链\">4. 链文字与链</h1>\n<p>标记集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Tag=\\{B,A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Tag=\\{B,A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>链文字集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"CLit_\\Sigma=Lit_\\Sigma\\times Tag.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[CLit_\\Sigma=Lit_\\Sigma\\times Tag.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:L\">\\(B:L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:L\">\\(A:L\\)</span>。链集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Chain_\\Sigma\">\\(Chain_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"CLit_\\Sigma\">\\(CLit_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的有限列集合。开放文字谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Open(B:L),\\qquad \\neg Open(A:L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Open(B:L),\\qquad \\neg Open(A:L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>链自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_K(K)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|K|}FV_L(L_i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_K(K)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|K|}FV_L(L_i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(i)\">\\(K(i)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:L_i\">\\(B:L_i\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:L_i\">\\(A:L_i\\)</span>。替换作用于底层文字并保留标记：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(B:L)\\theta=B:(L\\theta),\\qquad (A:L)\\theta=A:(L\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(B:L)\\theta=B:(L\\theta),\\qquad (A:L)\\theta=A:(L\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-变量分离与选择\">5. 变量分离与选择</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ren_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\n\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ren_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\n\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量分离关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart(K,C,C&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\,\n\\bigl(C&#39;=C\\bar\\rho\\land FV_C(C&#39;)\\cap FV_K(K)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart(K,C,C&#39;)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\in Ren_\\Sigma\\,\n\\bigl(C&#39;=C\\bar\\rho\\land FV_C(C&#39;)\\cap FV_K(K)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"sel_{ME}\">\\(sel_{ME}\\)</span> 在含开放文字的链上取最左开放文字的位置：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"sel_{ME}(K)=\\min\\{i:\\exists B\\,\\exists L\\ K(i)=B:L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[sel_{ME}(K)=\\min\\{i:\\exists B\\,\\exists L\\ K(i)=B:L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有开放文字的链无被选位置。</p>\n<p>定义开放位置与祖先位置载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenPos}_{ME}(K)\n=\\{i&lt;|K|:\\exists L\\ K(i)=B:L\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OpenPos}_{ME}(K)\n=\\{i&lt;|K|:\\exists L\\ K(i)=B:L\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AncPos}_{ME}(K)\n=\\{i&lt;|K|:\\exists L\\ K(i)=A:L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AncPos}_{ME}(K)\n=\\{i&lt;|K|:\\exists L\\ K(i)=A:L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义链分解关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SplitOpen}_{ME}(K,i,K_0,L,K_1)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni\\in\\operatorname{OpenPos}_{ME}(K)\n\\land K=K_0\\smallfrown(B:L)\\smallfrown K_1\n\\land |K_0|=i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SplitOpen}_{ME}(K,i,K_0,L,K_1)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ni\\in\\operatorname{OpenPos}_{ME}(K)\n\\land K=K_0\\smallfrown(B:L)\\smallfrown K_1\n\\land |K_0|=i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>祖先前缀为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AncBefore}_{ME}(K,i)\n=\n(L_j:j&lt;i\\land K(j)=A:L_j),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AncBefore}_{ME}(K,i)\n=\n(L_j:j&lt;i\\land K(j)=A:L_j),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中保持原索引次序；当集合为空时结果为唯一空列。</p>\n<p>互补合一谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Comp(L,M,\\theta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P,Q\\in At_\\Sigma\\bigl(\\{L,M\\}=\\{pos(P),neg(Q)\\}\\wedge MGU(P,Q,\\theta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Comp(L,M,\\theta)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists P,Q\\in At_\\Sigma\\bigl(\\{L,M\\}=\\{pos(P),neg(Q)\\}\\wedge MGU(P,Q,\\theta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-扩展、归约与祖先删除\">6. 扩展、归约与祖先删除</h1>\n<p>对子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 与有限列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，定义枚举证书</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"EnumCl(C,e)\\Longleftrightarrow\ne:|C|\\to Lit_\\Sigma\\land\\operatorname{mset}(e)=C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[EnumCl(C,e)\\Longleftrightarrow\ne:|C|\\to Lit_\\Sigma\\land\\operatorname{mset}(e)=C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义三种有类型链操作：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Extend}_{ME}(K_0,L,K_1,e,\\theta)\n=\n\\bigl(K_0\\smallfrown(B:e(j))_{j&lt;|e|}\\smallfrown A:L\\smallfrown K_1\\bigr)\\theta,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Extend}_{ME}(K_0,L,K_1,e,\\theta)\n=\n\\bigl(K_0\\smallfrown(B:e(j))_{j&lt;|e|}\\smallfrown A:L\\smallfrown K_1\\bigr)\\theta,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reduce}_{ME}(K_0,K_1,\\theta)\n=(K_0\\smallfrown K_1)\\theta,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reduce}_{ME}(K_0,K_1,\\theta)\n=(K_0\\smallfrown K_1)\\theta,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DropAnc}_{ME}(K_0,L)=K_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DropAnc}_{ME}(K_0,L)=K_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始链证书为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InitCert}_{ME}(C,e,K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nEnumCl(C,e)\n\\land K=(B:e(j))_{j&lt;|e|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InitCert}_{ME}(C,e,K)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nEnumCl(C,e)\n\\land K=(B:e(j))_{j&lt;|e|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定输入子句集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(S\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>，扩展规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ME}^{ext}(S)\">\\(Rule_{ME}^{ext}(S)\\)</span> 定义为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=K_0\\smallfrown(B:L)\\smallfrown K_1\">\\(K=K_0\\smallfrown(B:L)\\smallfrown K_1\\)</span> 且被选位置为该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:L\">\\(B:L\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{ext}(S)\">\\((K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{ext}(S)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in S\">\\(C\\in S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\\in Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(C&#39;\\in Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(M\\in Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>、原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span>、替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 与有限列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart(K,C,C&#39;),\\qquad C&#39;(M)&gt;0,\n\\qquad \\{L,M\\}=\\{pos(P),neg(Q)\\},\\qquad MGU(P,Q,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart(K,C,C&#39;),\\qquad C&#39;(M)&gt;0,\n\\qquad \\{L,M\\}=\\{pos(P),neg(Q)\\},\\qquad MGU(P,Q,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"EnumCl(C&#39;-\\{M\\},e),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[EnumCl(C&#39;-\\{M\\},e),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K&#39;=\\operatorname{Extend}_{ME}(K_0,L,K_1,e,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K&#39;=\\operatorname{Extend}_{ME}(K_0,L,K_1,e,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>归约规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ME}^{red}\">\\(Rule_{ME}^{red}\\)</span> 定义为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=K_0\\smallfrown(B:L)\\smallfrown K_1\">\\(K=K_0\\smallfrown(B:L)\\smallfrown K_1\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{red}\">\\((K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{red}\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\">\\(K_0\\)</span> 中存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:M\">\\(A:M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Comp(L,M,\\theta)\">\\(Comp(L,M,\\theta)\\)</span>，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K&#39;=\\operatorname{Reduce}_{ME}(K_0,K_1,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K&#39;=\\operatorname{Reduce}_{ME}(K_0,K_1,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>祖先删除规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ME}^{drop}\">\\(Rule_{ME}^{drop}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(K_0\\smallfrown(A:L),K_0)\\in Rule_{ME}^{drop}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(K_0\\smallfrown(A:L),K_0)\\in Rule_{ME}^{drop}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\">\\(K_0\\)</span> 中没有开放文字。</p>\n<p>定义带标签转移证书关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME}^{S}(K,K&#39;,w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME}^{S}(K,K&#39;,w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当恰有下列一种情形：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=(\\mathsf{ext},i,C,C&#39;,M,\\theta,e)\n\\land i=sel_{ME}(K)\n\\land(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{ext}(S),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=(\\mathsf{ext},i,C,C&#39;,M,\\theta,e)\n\\land i=sel_{ME}(K)\n\\land(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{ext}(S),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=(\\mathsf{red},i,j,\\theta)\n\\land i=sel_{ME}(K)\n\\land j&lt;i\n\\land j\\in\\operatorname{AncPos}_{ME}(K)\n\\land(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{red},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=(\\mathsf{red},i,j,\\theta)\n\\land i=sel_{ME}(K)\n\\land j&lt;i\n\\land j\\in\\operatorname{AncPos}_{ME}(K)\n\\land(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{red},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w=(\\mathsf{drop},|K|-1)\n\\land(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{drop}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w=(\\mathsf{drop},|K|-1)\n\\land(K,K&#39;)\\in Rule_{ME}^{drop}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此扩展、归约和祖先删除均是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Chain_\\Sigma\\times Chain_\\Sigma\">\\(Chain_\\Sigma\\times Chain_\\Sigma\\)</span> 上带有限证书的状态转移。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-模型消去推导\">7. 模型消去推导</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 出发的初始链集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{ME}(S)\n=\n\\{K\\in Chain_\\Sigma:\n\\exists C\\in S\\,\\exists e\\ \n\\operatorname{InitCert}_{ME}(C,e,K)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{ME}(S)\n=\n\\{K\\in Chain_\\Sigma:\n\\exists C\\in S\\,\\exists e\\ \n\\operatorname{InitCert}_{ME}(C,e,K)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:C\">\\(B:C\\)</span> 是把子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的全部文字列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 标记链。模型消去推导是非空有限链序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(K_0,\\ldots,K_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(K_0,\\ldots,K_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\\in Init_{ME}(S)\">\\(K_0\\in Init_{ME}(S)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1&lt;m\">\\(i+1&lt;m\\)</span>，存在证书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME}^{S}(K_i,K_{i+1},w_i)\">\\(\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME}^{S}(K_i,K_{i+1},w_i)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>形式推导谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{ME}(S,\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{ME}(S,\\Pi)\\)</span> 定义为存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Chain_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\Pi(0)\\in Init_{ME}(S)\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ \\exists w_i\\ \n\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME}^{S}(\\Pi(i),\\Pi(i+1),w_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Chain_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\Pi(0)\\in Init_{ME}(S)\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ \\exists w_i\\ \n\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME}^{S}(\\Pi(i),\\Pi(i+1),w_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-反驳关系\">8. 反驳关系</h1>\n<p>空链记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash_{ME}\\bot\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{ME}(S,\\Pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{LastChain}_{ME}(\\Pi)=\\langle\\rangle\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\vdash_{ME}\\bot\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{ME}(S,\\Pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{LastChain}_{ME}(\\Pi)=\\langle\\rangle\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LastChain}_{ME}(\\Pi)=K\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Chain_\\Sigma\\wedge \\Pi(m-1)=K\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LastChain}_{ME}(\\Pi)=K\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Chain_\\Sigma\\wedge \\Pi(m-1)=K\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反驳类为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ref_{ME}=\\{S:S\\vdash_{ME}\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ref_{ME}=\\{S:S\\vdash_{ME}\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异条款\">9. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标差异为：本系统的证明状态是带祖先标记的链，核心步骤是扩展、归约和祖先删除；它不同于普通归结的子句到子句推导，也不同于连接演算的矩阵路径证书。</p>\n<p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{ME}\n=\n(Chain_\\Sigma,Init_{ME},Rule_{ME}^{ext},Rule_{ME}^{red},\nRule_{ME}^{drop},\\operatorname{Der}_{ME},Ref_{ME}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{ME}\n=\n(Chain_\\Sigma,Init_{ME},Rule_{ME}^{ext},Rule_{ME}^{red},\nRule_{ME}^{drop},\\operatorname{Der}_{ME},Ref_{ME}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ModelElimination}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nLit_\\Sigma,\nCl_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{supp},\n\\in_m,\n\\Box,\n[-],\n\\oplus,\n\\ominus,\n|-|,\n\\operatorname{mset},\n\\overline{(-)},\nFV_C,\nFV_K,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nRen_\\Sigma,\nChain_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{OpenPos}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{AncPos}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{SplitOpen}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{AncBefore}_{ME},\nMGU,\nApart,\nComp,\nEnumCl,\n\\operatorname{Extend}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{Reduce}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{DropAnc}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{InitCert}_{ME},\nsel_{ME},\nInit_{ME},\nRule_{ME}^{ext},\nRule_{ME}^{red},\nRule_{ME}^{drop},\n\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{LastChain}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{ME},\n\\vdash_{ME},\nRef_{ME},\n\\Delta_{ME}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ModelElimination}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nLit_\\Sigma,\nCl_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{supp},\n\\in_m,\n\\Box,\n[-],\n\\oplus,\n\\ominus,\n|-|,\n\\operatorname{mset},\n\\overline{(-)},\nFV_C,\nFV_K,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nRen_\\Sigma,\nChain_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{OpenPos}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{AncPos}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{SplitOpen}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{AncBefore}_{ME},\nMGU,\nApart,\nComp,\nEnumCl,\n\\operatorname{Extend}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{Reduce}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{DropAnc}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{InitCert}_{ME},\nsel_{ME},\nInit_{ME},\nRule_{ME}^{ext},\nRule_{ME}^{red},\nRule_{ME}^{drop},\n\\operatorname{StepCert}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{LastChain}_{ME},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{ME},\n\\vdash_{ME},\nRef_{ME},\n\\Delta_{ME}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含带祖先标记链的扩展、归约、祖先删除和空链反驳；不含线性归结状态、矩阵全路径证书或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-子句签名","text":"1. 子句签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、原子、文字与子句","text":"2. 项、原子、文字与子句","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换、合一","text":"3. 自由变量、替换、合一","level":1},{"id":"4.-链文字与链","text":"4. 链文字与链","level":1},{"id":"5.-变量分离与选择","text":"5. 变量分离与选择","level":1},{"id":"6.-扩展、归约与祖先删除","text":"6. 扩展、归约与祖先删除","level":1},{"id":"7.-模型消去推导","text":"7. 模型消去推导","level":1},{"id":"8.-反驳关系","text":"8. 反驳关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异条款","text":"9. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)","display":false},{"tex":"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"var,fun,rel,pos,neg","display":false},{"tex":"Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F(f)=n","display":false},